1	// sc4sap:program-to-spec — Markdown image renderer.
2	//
3	// The xlsx path (build-spec.mjs) clones a template and SWAPS PNGs into it.
4	// Markdown has no template — it references images by relative path. This
5	// helper renders the SAME program-specific PNGs (Selection / ALV / Process
